; Hamana.mouse - a homage profile for MView.
;
; Hamana (Makito Miyano, last version 2006) was the viewer MView grew
; out of.
; This profile gives MView Hamana's mouse, as it was set up in the
; Hamana.key MView's author used for years (decoded in
; docs\Hamana_Commands.md):
;   - the wheel steps through the images at the top right (by name)
;     and at the bottom left (by date), and zooms everywhere else;
;   - right-drag gestures: left / right = previous / next folder,
;     up = parent folder, down = exit;
;   - right click = original size; wheel click = fullscreen;
;   - Space = next image, Enter = fullscreen.
;
; Where MView differs, on purpose:
;   - Hamana's wheel at the top right also zoomed (its "if" without an
;     "else"); here each zone does one thing.
;   - Hamana's X1 / X2 panned; MView pans with the left button, so
;     X1 = zoom mode (as in MView) and X2 = the menu (Hamana's menu was
;     on a key). The right click stays instant: no double-click on it.
;   - Edit mode as in MView: left click in the top left zone = on,
;     double-click there = off.
;   - The tilt wheel (Hamana had none) steps through the folders.
;   - No rotation by mouse (Hamana turned the image with keys).
;
; To use it: this file must be next to MView.ini (copy it there FIRST:
; if MView doesn't find the file, it writes its own default profile
; under that name). Then, in MView.ini under [Mouse]:
;   Profile=Hamana.mouse
; Back to MView's own profile: Profile=Default.mouse

[Anywhere]
RightClick   = OriginalSize
WheelClick   = Fullscreen
LeftDouble   = FitOr100
TiltLeft     = PreviousFolder
TiltRight    = NextFolder
X1           = ZoomMode
X2           = Menu
GestureLeft  = PreviousFolder
GestureRight = NextFolder
GestureUp    = ParentFolder
GestureDown  = Exit
WheelDown    = ZoomIn
WheelUp      = ZoomOut

[Zone TopLeft]
Name       = Hamana: zoom, edit
Order      = None
LeftClick  = EditModeOn
LeftDouble = EditModeOff

[Zone TopRight]
Name       = Hamana: by name
Order      = Name
WheelDown  = NextImage
WheelUp    = PreviousImage

[Zone BottomLeft]
Name       = Hamana: by date
Order      = Date
WheelDown  = NextImage
WheelUp    = PreviousImage

[Zone BottomRight]
Name       = Hamana: zoom
Order      = None

[Keys]
Space = NextImage
Enter = Fullscreen
D     = Diagnostics
